graph TD
    User((Student/Lecturer/Admin)) -->|HTTPS/JWT| Nginx[Nginx Reverse Proxy]
    Nginx -->|Static Files| Frontend[Vue 3 Frontend]
    Nginx -->|API Requests| Backend[Go Gin Backend]

    subgraph Auth & RBAC
        Backend --> AuthService[Auth Service]
        AuthService --> JWT[JWT Verification]
        AuthService --> RBAC[Role-Based Access Control]
    end

    subgraph Core Features
        Backend --> QuizCtrl[Quiz Controller]
        Backend --> LecturerCtrl[Lecturer Controller]
        QuizCtrl --> Exams[Examination Management]
        LecturerCtrl --> Questions[Question Management]
    end

    subgraph Concurrency
        QuizCtrl -->|DML only| Queue[SubmissionQueue<br/>1 worker · cap 256 · 30s timeout]
        QuizCtrl -.->|SELECT: lock-free,<br/>30s context.WithTimeout| Logic
    end

    subgraph Docker Container
        Backend -->|SQL| DB[(PostgreSQL)]
        DB -->|app schema| AppDB[System Tables<br/>users / exams / questions / submissions / exam_sandboxes]
        DB -->|public schema, frozen on activate| MainDB[Lecturer Curriculum<br/>clone template · SELECT-only via exam_student_readonly]
        DB -.->|cloned once at activation<br/>LIKE INCLUDING ALL + INSERT SELECT| ExamDB[Per-exam DML Sandbox<br/>sandbox_exam_{examID}<br/>shared across all enrolled students]
        DB -->|per-category schema, lecturer-imported| PracticeDB[Practice Category DBs<br/>practice_cat_{categoryID}<br/>isolated from public · SELECT + DML]
    end

    subgraph Evaluation Logic
        Backend --> Logic[Validation Engine]
        Queue -->|serialised DML| Logic
        Logic -->|BEGIN; SAVEPOINT student_eval;<br/>… ROLLBACK TO SAVEPOINT; COMMIT| ExamDB
        Logic -->|SELECT under exam_student_readonly| MainDB
        Logic -->|practice SELECT + DML<br/>savepoint-rollback| PracticeDB
        Logic -->|cached expected_result comparison| AppDB
    end
